OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain across western
OL,7,Fareas sweeping eastwards. A wet night
OL,8,Fwith strong winds and coastal gales or
OL,9,Fsevere gales. Rain probably turning to
OL,10,Fsqually showers later in the night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FMostly cloudy day with rain
OL,13,Fand showers as Storm Austen moves
OL,14,Feast. Strongest winds likely through
OL,15,Fthe afternoon, with gales, as rain
OL,16,Fclears east. Drier and brighter later
OL,17,Fin west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
